 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Immersion matters a lot. Spend at least few weeks each living with the language as if you were normal. Follow a list. There are so many random words that it's easy to miss the ones you actually hear. Stick with simple novels for a few months. They' easy to find and give you a lot of practice. They' very popular with beginners. You can usually find them in the foreign language.",
